      "benefits": "General: Brings stable growth, protection from setbacks, and a steady flow of positive energy in daily life. Health: Supports neck, nerve, lower-back, and kidney health, and aids strength recovery in paralytic conditions. Spiritual: Boosts inner strength, emotional steadiness, and a clear, confident state of mind.",
