      "benefits": "The Gaurishankar Rudraksha is a special bead that symbolizes the union of Lord Shiva and Goddess Parvati. This Rudraksha brings harmony, happiness, and prosperity in relationships, especially marriage. Here are some of the benefits of wearing the Gaurishankar Rudraksha: General Benefits: Wearing it improves and heals relationships, brings marital happiness, and helps to find the right partner. It also promotes peace and harmony with family. Spiritual Benefits: The bead calms the mind, reduces stress, and enhances decision-making. It is ruled by the Moon, the planet of emotions and intuition. Health Benefits: It is beneficial for cough, cold, and chest problems. It strengthens the respiratory system and immunity.",
