      "description": "Presiding Deity - Lord Surya Ruling Planet - Sun Beej Mantra - Om Krowm Kshowm Rowm Namah: Description - The 12 Mukhi Surya Power Pendant Surya Power in Gold is replete with the 12 Mukhi Rudraksha, a rare and precious Rudraksha blessed by Lord Aditya, the Sun God. The 12 Mukhi Rudraksha builds reputation, fame, position, power, and authority and improves leadership and administrative qualities. It’s good for people involved in professions like healthcare, law, C.A.s, etc., and to strengthen internal organs and cure ailments related to the eye, heart, and skin. Politicians, businessmen, and people striving for success can wear this pendant to achieve radiance, leadership, and success. The pendant is crafted together with pure 22-carat hallmark gold and designed to be worn on the neck. The Surya Power in Gold is a perfect choice for anyone who wants to enjoy the grace of Aditya and the benefits of Rudraksha. Configuration - 1 x 12 Mukhi",
      "benefits": "The 12 Mukhi Rudraksha has many benefits for the wearer, both spiritual and material. Some benefits are: Health Benefits: It strengthens internal organs and is beneficial for ailments affecting the eyes, skin, and the heart. Spiritual Benefits: It evokes self-power and makes the person shine bright and radiant like the sun. The scriptures refer to the Sun as the Atman, the soul of all beings. Thus Sun is none other than the self. The Prana or the vital force essential for life is Aditya / Sun. As per scriptures wearing a 12 Mukhi Rudraksha close to the chest ensures its proximity to the heart. Thus the heart / Anahata Chakra is energized. General Benefits : It enhances confidence, courage, and leadership skills. It attracts wealth, fame, and success. It aids in gaining name, fame, power, and position. It substantially enhances the qualities of leadership and administration. Professionals like lawyers, doctors, and chartered accountants benefit from this bead. It improves the confidence and the motivating capacity of the wearer, allowing them to be a leader or a trailblazer for others and lead others onto the path of glory. A 12 Mukhi hanging is used to rectify the defects of Vaastu.",
      "whoShouldWear": "The 12 Mukhi Rudraksha is beneficial for people who need to make decisions and lead with authority, such as administrators, doctors, lawyers, and chartered accountants . Other professions may involve - People who wish to heal diseases, especially those related to the digestive organs, heart, and eyesight are suggested to wear it. People who require to work on reducing stress and anger are advised to wear a 12 Mukhi Rudraksha. Individuals dealing with worry, suspicion, dependency, and poor self-esteem can also wear it.",
      "wearingRules": "Wash and oil your Rudraksha with almond oil monthly using a soft brush and chant ‘Om Namah Shivaye’ before wearing it the next day. Remove it during sexual intercourse and funeral visits. You can remove it while eating non-vegetarian food or drinking alcohol and wear it again later. Women can wear it all the time, even during their menstrual cycles. To energize it, touch it to a shivling and chant ‘Om Namah Shivaye’ 11 times. Perform a Rudrabhishek of it when possible. Do not wear or use a Rudraksha Mala worn by others. Keep a separate Mala for Japa and for wearing."
